    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_01",
      "hash64": "3530CCAE0E1378E7",
      "text": "Bonjour ! Je suis la préposée aux Héliatronc\\nde l’Arène. C’est pour ça qu’on me surnomme\\r\\nla Fille aux Héliatronc !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_06",
      "hash64": "3530C9AE0E1373CE",
      "text": "Alors, c’est vous l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]ea candidat[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ?\\nÊtes-vous prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à rassembler les Héliatronc ?\\c\\nDans ce cas, je vais leur demander d’aller\\nse cacher en ville de suite !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_07",
      "hash64": "3530CAAE0E137581",
      "text": "Hélia, Héliatronc !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_09",
      "hash64": "3530C4AE0E136B4F",
      "text": "Je crois qu’ils sont prêts !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_10",
      "hash64": "3533D1AE0E15B73D",
      "text": "Alors, que l’examen commence !\\c\\nQuand vous aurez trouvé [VAR 0x0201(0001)] Héliatronc,\\nraccompagnez-le[VAR 0x1101(0001,0100)]s ici, sur la Place Héliatronc.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_11",
      "hash64": "3533D0AE0E15B58A",
      "text": "Eh bien, qu’attendez-vous ? Allez-y !\\nEt bonne cueillette !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_02",
      "hash64": "3530CDAE0E137A9A",
      "text": "Laissez-moi voir...\\nVous avez [VAR 0x0201(0001)] Héliatronc avec vous !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_03",
      "hash64": "3530CEAE0E137C4D",
      "text": "Quand vous en aurez trouvé [VAR 0x0201(0002)],\\nraccompagnez-le[VAR 0x1101(0002,0100)]s ici, sur la place !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_04",
      "hash64": "3530C7AE0E137068",
      "text": "Merci d’avoir trouvé tous les Héliatronc !\\nVous avez réussi votre examen ! Bravo !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_05",
      "hash64": "3530C8AE0E13721B",
      "text": "Je vous laisse aller faire votre rapport\\nà la réception de l’Arène de Cuencia !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "01E16E63DBE19BED",
      "text": "Voulez-vous à nouveau passer l’examen d’Arène\\net partir à la cueillette des Héliatronc ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "01E16D63DBE19A3A",
      "text": "Dans ce cas, allez-y ! Trouvez-en [VAR 0x0201(0001)]\\net raccompagnez-les ici, sur la place !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "01E16063DBE18423",
      "text": "Bonne cueillette !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_kusapoke_10",
      "hash64": "F905C97956842618",
      "text": "Si vous quittez la ville, vous devrez repartir\\nà la recherche des Héliatronc que vous aviez\\r\\ndéjà localisés...\\c\\nVoulez-vous tout de même sortir de la ville ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_kusapoke_11",
      "hash64": "F905CA79568427CB",
      "text": "Vous avez abandonné.\\c\\nSi vous voulez à nouveau passer l’examen,\\nrendez-vous sur la Place Héliatronc !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
